    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68979" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μύ̆δ-ησις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>dampness, clamminess</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>CD</u>
				1.4
			</span></i>; esp. of the eyelids, <i>purulent blepharitis</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἱ ἐν ὀφθαλμοῖς μ. τῶν βλεφάρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.7
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				14.770
			</span></i>; also, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μυδήσεις οὔλων</span>,
			prob. <i>pyorrhoea</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Dsc.
				1.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>putrefaction</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Diog.Oen.
				16
			</span></i>.</div>
